 "description": "<p>Oqaatsut (old spelling: Oqaitsut), formerly Rodebay, is a settlement in the Qaasuitsup municipality, in western Greenland. It had 46 inhabitants in 2010. The modern name of the settlement is Kalaallisut for &quot;Cormorants&quot;. The village is served by the communal all-purpose Pisiffik store. Source: <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oqaatsut\" target=\"_blank\">Wikipedia</a></p><p>For further information (in Danish) see also the Danish Geodata Agency:&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.gronlandskehavnelods.dk/#HID=49\" target=\"_blank\">Den grønlandske Havnelods</a></p>",
